# Variable data of the hosting platform, excluded from AIDE (the catch-all `/ 0 Full` of 99_aide_root
# would hash it every day: thousands of tenants, all databases and backups, ~2 GB RAM and hours per run).
# System files, configuration, the backend/frontend and the shared skeletons stay checked.

# tenants: each site's own files (uploads, caches, generated assets, config)
!{{ paths.tenants.root | regex_escape }}(/|$)
# backups
!{{ paths.backup_root | regex_escape }}(/|$)
# databases
!/var/lib/mysql(/|$)
